flowchart TD
    A[Versioned synthetic test cases] --> B[Load case input and expected fields]
    B --> C[Run deterministic policy evaluator]
    C --> D[Compare actual and expected fields]
    D --> E{All cases match?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Report pass rate and exit 0]
    E -- No --> G[Report failing cases and exit 1]
    G --> H[Investigate policy drift]
    H --> I[Update policy or approve an intentional expectation change]
    I --> A
